window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I’ve loved her across centuries, but this time, she might destroy me.</b></p> <p>For thousands of years, Marius Baciu has roamed the earth, searching for the woman whose soul is forever bound to his. In the blood-soaked trenches of World War I, he finds her again—Sophia Calo, a beautiful Italian nurse whose grace and strength shine through the horrors of war. But this time, she’s promised to another, a man of wealth and power, and her future seems sealed.</p> <p>Marius knows the truth: Sophia is the reincarnation of the woman he has loved in every lifetime. But when a brutal battle exposes his secret—that he’s not just a man, but an immortal vampire—Sophia must choose between the life she’s bound to and the irresistible pull of a love that has defied time itself.</p> <p>As war rages around them and danger closes in, their love could be Marius’s salvation—or it could be his undoing.</p> <p><b><i>Entrenched</i></b><i> is a tale of passion, fate, and betrayal, where love transcends time but comes at a price. In a world torn apart by war and dark forces, Marius and Sophia must fight not just for their love, but for their very survival.</i></p> <p>Suitable for 18+ due to mature themes.</p> <p><b>Entrenched: A Tale of Timeless Desire</b><br> <i>Book 1 of The Romances of Marius Baciu, Vampire Extraordinaire</i></p>"; 
